  data: {
    LLM: "Commit early. If you start with two Hearts, keep those Hearts and discard anything else. Changing suits mid-game is usually a recipe for defeat.\n\nWatch the Discards: If you see your opponent discarding Diamonds, that means Diamonds are 'safe' for you to build as they won't be competing for the cards you need.\n\nThe Ace Bait: If you hold an Ace of a suit you aren't using, hold onto it as long as possible. This 'chokes' the game for whoever is trying to build that suit, potentially forcing them to settle for a lower score.",
    Player: "Commit early. If you start with two Hearts, keep those Hearts and discard anything else. Changing suits mid-game is usually a recipe for defeat.\n\nWatch the Discards: If you see your opponent discarding Diamonds, that means Diamonds are 'safe' for you to build as they won't be competing for the cards you need.\n\nThe Ace Bait: If you hold an Ace of a suit you aren't using, hold onto it as long as possible. This 'chokes' the game for whoever is trying to build that suit, potentially forcing them to settle for a lower score.",
